  "id": "cauliflower-cheese-mash-with-sage-butter",
  "name": "Cauliflower Cheese Mash with Sage Butter",
  "subtitle": "A smooth cauliflower side finished with crisp sage and browned butter.",
  "description": "Tender cauliflower is blended with crème fraîche and parmesan, then topped with sage-infused butter for a savory side dish.",
  "meal_type": "side",
